#: AboutDialog.cpp:42
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Freoffice is a mobile edition of KOffice Open source project. "
#| "<br>Freoffice code can be found in the KOffice Open Source project. "
#| "<br>Freoffice is in beta edition and it supports viewing of spreadsheet, "
#| "presentation and document in both<br>Open document format (ODF) and "
#| "Microsoft format. <br>The editing functionality is limited to ODF "
#| "documents only."
msgid ""
"Freoffice is a mobile edition of Calligra Open source project. <br/"
">Freoffice code can be found in the Calligra Open Source project. <br/"
">Freoffice is in beta edition and it supports viewing of spreadsheet, "
"presentation and document in both<br/>Open document format (ODF) and "
"Microsoft format. <br/>The editing functionality is limited to ODF documents "
"only."
msgstr ""
"FreOffice est l' modêye axhlåve do pordjet libe KOffice. <br>Li côde da "
"FreOffice si trove e pordjet libe KOffice. <br>FreOffice est co e modêye "
"beta eyet i sopoite li håynaedje di tåvleas, prezintaedjes eyet documints "
"dins les deus cognes<br>Open document format (ODF) eyet Microsoft. <br>On n' "
"si sait siervi del fonccionålité d' aspougnaedje ki po les documints ODF."

